WEBVTT

00:54:59.954 --> 00:55:03.621
you know, and who now are 14 and 16.

00:55:04.121 --> 00:55:10.829
And I just feel like, wow, OK, I really
now I'm ready to go back.

00:55:11.204 --> 00:55:16.413
Go back to that basic go back to that
sit there and write your next book.

00:55:16.663 --> 00:55:17.746
And so that's what I'm doing.

00:55:17.746 --> 00:55:20.496
And I really want to do it and
I'm really excited about it.

00:55:21.371 --> 00:55:26.621
I'm also afraid and doubtful as scared at
all the things I am when I'm writing,

00:55:26.788 --> 00:55:28.121
which means I'm writing my next book.

00:55:28.538 --> 00:55:31.121
I can't wait to read it,
cannot wait to read it.